    {
      "id": "p1",
      "text": "An online provocateur in Seoul fabricated a digital farce, using AI-generated audio and manipulated chat screenshots to monetize a viral lie about a scandal-target celebrity. The capital city's police force intervened with law enforcement action, securing an arrest warrant that led to the clown being cuffed. This absurd circus, rooted in misinformation and deceptive practice, not only silenced the star's public appearances but also exposed the farcical gap between solemn institutions and ridiculous viral hoaxes.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Jester",
