      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.95
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "In a classic case of financially motivated rumor-spreading, a content creator staged a hoax with deepfakes, prompting authorities to intervene. The arrest made in this urban center highlighted the professional impact on the actor, whose career ground to a halt amid reputational damage. It was a jester's gambit—exposing the fabrication of evidence through a public spectacle that mocked the very notion of digital manipulation.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Jester",
        "fragments": [
          "why-0",
          "how-0",
          "how-1",
          "result-0",
          "result-1"
        ],
