      "fit": 0.88
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "What began as spreading misinformation for gain spiraled into a legal procedure spectacle when Seoul police, acting as court performers, issued a warrant for the jester. The consequence of crime was swift detention, but the real punchline was the consequence of scandal: the celebrity's endorsements vanished, leaving a trail of reputational damage. This entire episode served as a release of present-tense absurdity, puncturing the solemnity of celebrity culture with a viral hoax.",
